6f8d027911"}],"files_count":32,"item_last_updated":1704109630,"item_size":213288432,"metadata":{"identifier":"noise-arch_zeitastro","collection":["noise-arch","cassettetapes"],"date":"2009","description":"A digitized tape from the NOISE-ARCH Archives. Identifier: zeitastro","mediatype":"audio","scanner":"Internet Archive Python library 0.9.8","subject":"Cassette;Tape;Noise-Arch;Independent","title":"NOISE-ARCH: Zeitgeist - Astronomer","publicdate":"2015-12-03 03:41:36","uploader":"jscott@archive.org","addeddate":"2015-12-03 03:41:36","backup_location":"ia905506_3"},"reviews":[{"reviewbody":"Yeah this isnt gonna be a classic review, but rather a recommendation for anyone who happens to click on this tape;\n\nFavorite it, download it, cherish it. Its brilliant !","reviewtitle":"Just found my new jam","reviewer":"TheNorseViking","reviewdate":"2015-12-16 07:46:17","createdate":"2015-12-16 07:46:17","stars":"3"},{"reviewbody":"Maybe it's the 80s synthesizers. Maybe it's the warmth of the cassette recording. Whatever it is, this album is just beautiful.","reviewtitle":"Just something about this","reviewer":"derangedtm","reviewdate":"2016-08-11 15:43:15","createdate":"2016-08-11 15:43:15","stars":"5"},{"reviewbody":"This is a really beautiful lil cassette, and I'm surprised it doesn't get more love. My only problem is that it seems that the track listing on the J-Card isn't accurate; there's not only one extra unlisted track but the times go completely off by the 6th track of side 2. \"metabalic structures\" is listed as a 3:50 long song, but in reality the song that plays is 5 minutes long. Regardless, it's definitely worth your time.","reviewtitle":"Gorgeous album","reviewer":"FMVDog","reviewdate":"2017-01-19 02:22:41","createdate":"2017-01-19 02:22:41","stars":"5"},{"reviewbody":"Fine fare for chillaxation.","reviewtitle":"Dreamy & ambient","reviewer":"jackomatik","reviewdate":"2017-07-23 18:16:04","createdate":"2017-07-23 16:28:51","stars":"4"},{"reviewbody":"https://www.discogs.com/Zeitgeist-Astronomer/release/9847047","reviewtitle":"Zeitgeist – Astronomer","reviewer":"Zan Hoffman","reviewer_itemname":"@zan_hoffman","reviewdate":"2019-06-30 17:48:08","createdate":"2019-06-30 17:48:08","stars":"0"},{"reviewtitle":"Tremulous Grumbling Under the Himalayas","reviewbody":"Positive reviews! I was surprised, it is an album, not a compilation like much of my new love \"NOISE-ARCH.\" I am getting through the catalog, and this one drowns you in velvet... like John Carpenter doing New Age music.\n\n Sneak out of your house tonight and listen to it, while you look down some overgrown ravine. No matter who comes toward you out of that dark brush, remain silent! ","stars":"5","reviewer":"skoalbandit","reviewdate":"2021-05-07 03:33:37","createdate":"2021-05-07 03:33:37","reviewer_itemname":"@skoalbandit"}],"server":"ia801301.us.archive.org","uniq":337418930,"workable_servers":["ia801301.us.archive.org","ia601301.us.archive.org"]}